</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c8adca60-6ea7-11f1-a125-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26174051553368.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c8adca60-6ea7-11f1-a125-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26174051553368.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">0d33ccc8-7c3d-11f1-869e-0b49c900324f</guid><pubDate>Fri, 10 Jul 2026 08:55:07 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c8adca60-6ea7-11f1-a125-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26174051553368.jpg">AP Photo/Steve Luciano - Steve Luciano</source><dc:creator>左依</dc:creator></item><item><category>亚洲</category><title>又有22艘日本相关船舶通过霍尔木兹海峡</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%B2/20260710-%E5%8F%88%E6%9C%8922%E8%89%98%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E8%88%B9%E8%88%B6%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E9%9C%8D%E5%B0%94%E6%9C%A8%E5%85%B9%E6%B5%B7%E5%B3%A1</link><description>
