</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/d71ad3a6-7972-11f1-b1d0-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/K6Y5WQCXVNCTNJ4DEWKBKOGHIQ.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/d71ad3a6-7972-11f1-b1d0-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/K6Y5WQCXVNCTNJ4DEWKBKOGHIQ.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">6d67704a-7bca-11f1-b55b-41b521351a1f</guid><pubDate>Thu, 09 Jul 2026 19:14:36 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/d71ad3a6-7972-11f1-b1d0-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/K6Y5WQCXVNCTNJ4DEWKBKOGHIQ.jpg">Alamy / Icon Sport - SPP Sport Press Photo.  / Alamy Stock Photo</source><dc:creator>法广</dc:creator></item><item><category>法国</category><title>14 Juillet :“ 500名“志愿联盟”士兵在国庆阅兵打头阵</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD/20260709-14-juillet-500%E5%90%8D-%E5%BF%97%E6%84%BF%E8%81%94%E7%9B%9F-%E5%A3%AB%E5%85%B5%E5%9C%A8%E5%9B%BD%E5%BA%86%E9%98%85%E5%85%B5%E6%89%93%E5%A4%B4%E9%98%B5</link><description>
